      395.13
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends the section 10 of the Customs Ordinance (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of that section as amendedis to provide for an appeal relating to imposition of tax under section 10 to the TaxAppeals Commission established under Tax Appeals Commission Act.",
