  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      250.97,
      397.18,
      286.31
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 153 of the principal enactment is herebyamended,by the repeal of paragraph (b) of subsection (2) ofthat section and the substitution therefor, of the following:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      168.43,
      298.97,
      397.19,
      382.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(b)(i) the other half into the reward fund which shallbe administered by the Director-General inaccordance with guideliens to be issued by theMinister, on the distribution among officers andservants employed in the service of Customs andthe informers, and for capacity developmentactivities of the Customs.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      172.15,
      394.97,
      397.18,
      442.31
    ],
    "text": "(ii)all amounts remaining out of sums allocated forcapacity development activities in sub-paragraph(i) shall, at the end of each financial year be remittedto Deputy Secretary to the Treasury.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      169.15,
      454.97,
      397.18,
      478.31
    ],
    "text": "(iii)every guidelines issued by the Minister under thisparagraph shall be published in the Gazette.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      490.97,
      397.2,
      514.31
    ],
    "text": "4.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
